    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent start, very safe. But honestly, the campaign manager just looked at the draft and said the 'inspiration index' score was way too low. They want something that feels more... I don't know, emotionally charged? Like it really punches through the crowd.\n\nCan you take another pass at it? Try to make the language more vivid and evocative so the index hits a higher mark, but please, I'm serious, don't make it sound like a list of words. It still needs to sound like a human being talking to their neighbors, not a machine. Just make it more impactful.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
